o generate heat. By incorporating specific yoga poses, ayurvedic remedies, and lifestyle adjustments, you can effectively manage your condition and promote overall well-being.\",\"doshaAnalysis\":\"Your Pitta imbalance may be contributing to your high blood pressure, as this dosha is associated with heat, intensity, and a strong digestive fire. To restore balance, it\'s essential to incorporate cooling, calming, and soothing practices into your daily routine.\"}', '2026-01-20 12:42:10'),
(30, 6, 'indigestion', 'Age: 33, Gender: Male', 'Moderate', NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Stimulates digestion and relieves stress.\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your stomach with your hands under your shoulders\",\"Inhale and press your palms into the ground, lifting your chest and head off the mat\",\"Hold for 5 breaths, then slowly lower back down\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a neck or back injury\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\"},{\"name\":\"Pawanmuktasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"pawanmuktasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Massages the abdominal organs, relieving indigestion and gas.\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your back and bring your knees into your chest\",\"Hold your knees with your hands and rock gently from side to side\",\"Hold for 5 breaths, then slowly release\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a recent abdominal surgery or injury\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/UArmfqhbWLk\"},{\"name\":\"Vajrasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"vajrasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Improves digestion and reduces stress.\",\"steps\":[\"Kneel on the ground with your knees wide apart\",\"Sit back onto your heels and place your hands on your knees\",\"Hold for 5-10 breaths, focusing on your breath\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a knee injury\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/lDHE0Tvoyyo\"},{\"name\":\"Sukhasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"sukhasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Calms the mind and promotes relaxation, indirectly aiding digestion.\",\"steps\":[\"Sit comfortably with your back straight and legs crossed\",\"Place your hands on your knees and close your eyes\",\"Focus on your breath, holding for 5-10 minutes\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"None\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/ri9B8IzLXIY\"}]', '{\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Ginger Lemon\",\"image_keyword\":\"ginger_lemon.jpg\",\"usage\":\"Drink as a warm tea before mea