o pain and discomfort in the body. To address the upper leg pain, we need to focus on balancing the Vata dosha through yoga, diet, and lifestyle modifications.\"}', '2026-02-17 13:26:09'),
(37, 6, 'indigestion', 'Age: 27, Gender: Female', 'Moderate', NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Pawanmuktasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"pawanmuktasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Relieves gas and indigestion\",\"steps\":[\"Start on your back\",\"Lift your legs and hips\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a hernia or severe back pain\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/UArmfqhbWLk\"},{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens digestive system\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your stomach\",\"Lift your chest and head\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a neck or back injury\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\"},{\"name\":\"Sukhasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"sukhasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Calms the mind and aids digestion\",\"steps\":[\"Sit comfortably\",\"Close your eyes\",\"Focus on your breath\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"None\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/ri9B8IzLXIY\"},{\"name\":\"Anulom Vilom\",\"image_keyword\":\"anulom_vilom.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Regulates digestive system and reduces stress\",\"steps\":[\"Sit comfortably\",\"Close your eyes\",\"Alternate nostril breathing\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a cold or respiratory issue\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Nhw92icsQ1A\"}]', '{\"yoga\":[{\"name\":\"Pawanmuktasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"pawanmuktasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Relieves gas and indigestion\",\"steps\":[\"Start on your back\",\"Lift your legs and hips\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a hernia or severe back pain\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/UArmfqhbWLk\"},{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens digestive system\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your stomach\",\"Lift your chest and head\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid i