gged position with spine straight.\",\"Close the right nostril with the thumb and inhale deeply through the left.\",\"Close the left nostril with the ring finger and exhale through the right.\",\"Inhale through the right, then close it and exhale through the left.\",\"Continue this cycle for 5-10 minutes.\"],\"duration\":\"10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"none\"}],\"ayurveda\":[{\"name\":\"Triphala Churna\",\"image_keyword\":\"triphala.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"triphala powder;warm water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Take at night\",\"ingredients\":\"triphala powder;warm water\",\"preparation_time\":\"5 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Fennel Seeds Water\",\"image_keyword\":\"fennel_water.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"fennel seeds;water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Safe daily use\",\"ingredients\":\"fennel seeds;water\",\"preparation_time\":\"20 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Giloy Juice\",\"image_keyword\":\"giloy_juice.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/-KP4YkPl3j8?si=DfW_QuFc3tvNYK9m\",\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"giloy stem;water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Do not overdose\",\"ingredients\":\"giloy stem;water\",\"preparation_time\":\"25 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Ashwagandha Milk\",\"image_keyword\":\"ashwagandha.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"ashwagandha powder;milk;honey\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Take at night\",\"ingredients\":\"ashwagandha powder;milk;honey\",\"preparation_time\":\"10 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Methi Seeds Water\",\"image_keyword\":\"methi_seeds.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"fenugreek seeds;water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Soak overnight\",\"ingredients\":\"fenugreek seeds;water\",\"preparation_time\":\"480 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"}],\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Triphala Churna\",\"image_keyword\":\"triphala.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"triphala powder;warm water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Take at night\",\"ingredients\":\"triphala powder;warm water\",\"preparation_time\":\"5 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Fennel Seeds Water\",\"image_keyword\":\"fennel_water.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"fennel seeds;water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Safe daily use\",\"ingredients\":\"fennel seeds;water\",\"preparation_time\":\"20 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Giloy Juice\",\"image_keyword\":\"giloy_juice.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/-KP4YkPl3j8?si=DfW_QuFc3tvNYK9m\",\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"giloy stem;water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Do not overdose\",\"ingredients\":\"giloy stem;water\",\"preparation_time\":\"25 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Ashwagandha Milk\",\"image_keyword\":\"ashwagandha.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"ashwagandha powder;milk;honey\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Take at night\",\"ingredients\":\"ashwagandha powder;milk;honey\",\"preparation_time\":\"10 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"},{\"name\":\"Methi Seeds Water\",\"image_keyword\":\"methi_seeds.jpg\",\"video\":null,\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"usage\":\"fenugreek seeds;water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Soak overnight\",\"ingredients\":\"fenugreek seeds;water\",\"preparation_time\":\"480 mins\",\"type\":\"Herbal\"}],\"diet_tips\":[\"Cooling, hydrating foods (cucumber/ash gourd/coconut water). Prefer sweet/bitter/astringent tastes\",\" use fennel/coriander.\"],\"lifestyle_tips\":[\"Cooling breaks, manage workload, time in nature/water\",\" calming breathwork (Sheetali/Sheetkari, Nadi Shodhan).\"],\"diet_do\":\"Cooling, hydrating foods (cucumber/ash gourd/coconut water). Prefer sweet/bitter/astringent tastes; use fennel/coriander.\",\"diet_dont\":\"Very spicy, oily, sour/fermented foods; excess salt; alcohol/caffeine; overheating foods.\",\"lifestyle_do\":\"Cooling breaks, manage workload, time in nature/water; calming breathwork (Sheetali/Sheetkari, Nadi Shodhan).\",\"lifestyle_dont\":\"Heat exposure, hot yoga, late nights (especially 10 PM-2 AM), angry/competitive overload.\",\"exercise_do\":\"Moderate exercise in cooler hours; yoga/walk; avoid overheating.\",\"exercise_dont\":\"Very intense workouts that overheat you; hot environments post-meal.\",\"ayurvedic_support\":\"Support options (practitioner-advised): Amla, Guduchi, Neem; cooling teas (fennel/coriander/mint).\",\"support_timing\":\"Common timing: Amla often morning; cooling teas through daytime. Confirm exact timing/dose with practitioner.\",\"frequency_plan\":\"cooling breaks: 2-3/day; pranayama: 8-10 min; yoga/walk: 20-30 min; avoid late nights. (Dual-dosha: apply secondary constraints daily.)\",\"secondary_constraints\":\"Secondary Kapha: keep meals lighter; reduce sweets and heavy dairy; ensure daily movement.\",\"summary\":\"Personalized Ayurvedic plan to balance vata constitution.\",\"doshaAnalysis\":\"Your constitution is primarily governed by PITTA energy with a significant KAPHA influence. Currently, PITTA is the most active dosha in your system, which may manifest as excess heat and intensity. Balancing these forces will restore your natural vitality.\"}', '2026-02-19 09:05:00'),
(47, 6, 'shoulder pain', 'Age: 33, Gender: Female', 'Moderate', NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens back muscles and opens up the chest, relieving shoulder pain.\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your stomach with your hands under your shoulders\",\"Inhale and press your palms into the ground\",\"Lift your chest and head off the ground\",\"Keep your shoulders down and away from your ears\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a severe back or neck injury\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\"},{\"name\":\"Tadasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"tadasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Improves posture and reduces strain on the shoulders.\",\"steps\":[\"Stand with your feet hip-width apart\",\"Engage your core and feel a sense of length in your spine\",\"Arms by your sides, palms facing forward\",\"Shoulders relaxed, chest open\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"None\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/CTrRX7DcBSA\"}]', '{\"yoga\":[{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens back muscles and opens up the chest, relieving shoulder pain.\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your stomach with your hands under your shoulders\",\"Inhale and press your palms into the ground\",\"Lift your chest and head off the ground\",\"Keep your shoulders down and away from your ears\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have a severe back or neck injury\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\"},{\"name\":\"Tadasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"tadasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Improves posture and reduces strain on the shoulders.\",\"steps\":[\"Stand with your feet hip-width apart\",\"Engage your core and feel a sense of length in your spine\",\"Arms by your sides, palms facing forward\",\"Shoulders relaxed, chest open\",\"Hold for 5 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"None\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/CTrRX7DcBSA\"}],\"ayurveda\":[{\"name\":\"Tulsi Ginger Kadha\",\"image_keyword\":\"tulsi_ginger_kadha.jpg\",\"usage\":\"Boil 1 teaspoon of dried tulsi leaves and 1/2 teaspoon of grated ginger in 1 cup of water for 5 minutes. Strain and drink.\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Empty stomach morning\",\"benefits\":\"Reduces pain and inflammation, while also promoting relaxation and calming the mind.\",\"type\":\"Herb\",\"ingredients\":[\"Tulsi leaves\",\"Ginger\"],\"preparation_time\":\"5 mins\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/7WnEZyRFlK8?si=4874ls27t1rDryRa\"}],\"diet_tips\":[\"Eat warm, nourishing meals to balance Vata\",\"Include foods rich in omega-3 fatty acids, such as fish and flaxseeds\",\"Avoid cold, dry, or raw foods that can exacerbate Vata\"],\"lifestyle_tips\":[\"Get regular massage to relieve tension in the shoulders\",\"Practice stress-reducing techniques, such as meditation or deep breathing\",\"Take regular breaks to stretch and move throughout the day\"],\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Tulsi Ginger Kadha\",\"image_keyword\":\"tulsi_ginger_kadha.jpg\",\"usage\":\"Boil 1 teaspoon of dried tulsi leaves and 1/2 teaspoon of grated ginger in 1 cup of water for 5 minutes. Strain and drink.\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Empty stomach morning\",\"benefits\":\"Reduces pain and inflammation, while also promoting relaxation and calming the mind.\",\"type\":\"Herb\",\"ingredients\":[\"Tulsi leaves\",\"Ginger\"],\"preparation_time\":\"5 mins\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/7WnEZyRFlK8?si=4874ls27t1rDryRa\"}],\"summary\":\"As a 33-year-old Vata female with moderate shoulder pain, you can find relief through specific Ayurvedic yoga and remedies tailored to your needs. By incorporating these recommendations into your daily routine, you can potentially alleviate your shoulder pain and improve your overall well-being.\",\"doshaAnalysis\":\"The Vata dosha is associated with movement and air, and when out of balance, can lead to pain and discomfort in the body, including shoulder pain. To restore balance, it\'s essential to focus on practices that calm the nervous system and promote flexibility and strength in the shoulder area.\"}', '2026-02-19 09:09:44'),
