(51, 6, 'Back pain', 'Age: 23, Gender: Female', 'Moderate', NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens back muscles and improves posture.\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your stomach with your hands under your shoulders\",\"Inhale and press your palms into the ground\",\"Lift your chest and head off the ground\",\"Keep your shoulders down and away from your ears\",\"Hold for 5-10 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have severe back injuries or neck problems.\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\"},{\"name\":\"Balasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"balasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Stretches and relaxes the back muscles.\",\"steps\":[\"Kneel on the ground\",\"Sit back onto your heels\",\"Stretch your arms out in front of you\",\"Lower your forehead to the ground\",\"Hold for 5-10 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"None\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/2MJGg-dUKh0\"}]', '{\"yoga\":[{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens back muscles and improves posture.\",\"steps\":[\"Lie on your stomach with your hands under your shoulders\",\"Inhale and press your palms into the ground\",\"Lift your chest and head off the ground\",\"Keep your shoulders down and away from your ears\",\"Hold for 5-10 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"Avoid if you have severe back injuries or neck problems.\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\"},{\"name\":\"Balasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"balasana.jpg\",\"benefits\":\"Stretches and relaxes the back muscles.\",\"steps\":[\"Kneel on the ground\",\"Sit back onto your heels\",\"Stretch your arms out in front of you\",\"Lower your forehead to the ground\",\"Hold for 5-10 breaths\"],\"duration\":\"5-10 mins\",\"contraindications\":\"None\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/2MJGg-dUKh0\"}],\"ayurveda\":[{\"name\":\"Tulsi Ginger Kadha\",\"image_keyword\":\"tulsi_ginger_kadha.jpg\",\"usage\":\"Boil tulsi leaves, ginger, and water to make a soothing tea.\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Empty stomach morning\",\"benefits\":\"Reduces pain and inflammation.\",\"type\":\"Herb\",\"ingredients\":[\"Tulsi leaves\",\"Ginger\",\"Water\"],\"preparation_time\":\"10 mins\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/7WnEZyRFlK8?si=4874ls27t1rDryRa\"},{\"name\":\"Turmeric Milk\",\"image_keyword\":\"tumeric_milk.jpg\",\"usage\":\"Mix turmeric powder with warm milk and drink before bed.\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Before sleep\",\"benefits\":\"Reduces inflammation and promotes relaxation.\",\"type\":\"Herb\",\"ingredients\":[\"Turmeric powder\",\"Milk\"],\"preparation_time\":\"5 mins\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/Ih8ps6Ti_K0?si=GSblIS0725Ux6hxv\"}],\"diet_tips\":[\"Include warm, nourishing foods like soups and stews in your diet.\",\"Avoid cold, dry foods that can exacerbate Vata.\",\"Drink plenty of warm water throughout the day.\"],\"lifestyle_tips\":[\"Establish a regular sleep schedule to help regulate your Vata.\",\"Engage in gentle, grounding activities like walking or yoga.\",\"Practice stress-reducing techniques like meditation or deep breathing.\"],\"remedies\":[{\"name\":\"Tulsi Ginger Kadha\",\"image_keyword\":\"tulsi_ginger_kadha.jpg\",\"usage\":\"Boil tulsi leaves, ginger, and water to make a soothing tea.\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Empty stomach morning\",\"benefits\":\"Reduces pain and inflammation.\",\"type\":\"Herb\",\"ingredients\":[\"Tulsi leaves\",\"Ginger\",\"Water\"],\"preparation_time\":\"10 mins\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/7WnEZyRFlK8?si=4874ls27t1rDryRa\"},{\"name\":\"Turmeric Milk\",\"image_keyword\":\"tumeric_milk.jpg\",\"usage\":\"Mix turmeric powder with warm milk and drink before bed.\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Before sleep\",\"benefits\":\"Reduces inflammation and promotes relaxation.\",\"type\":\"Herb\",\"ingredients\":[\"Turmeric powder\",\"Milk\"],\"preparation_time\":\"5 mins\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/Ih8ps6Ti_K0?si=GSblIS0725Ux6hxv\"}],\"summary\":\"As a 23-year-old female with a Vata Prakriti, you are experiencing moderate back pain, and with the right combination of yoga, ayurvedic remedies, and lifestyle adjustments, you can find relief and improve your overall well-being. By incorporating these recommendations into your daily routine, you will be taking a holistic approach to managing your back pain and enhancing your health.\",\"doshaAnalysis\":\"Your Vata Prakriti indicates that you have a predominance of the elements of air and space, which can sometimes lead to imbalances such as back pain due to the light, dry, and mobile qualities of Vata. To balance your Vata, it\'s essential to focus on practices and remedies that promote grounding, warmth, and stability.\"}', '2026-02-25 08:20:37'),
(52, 3, 'Back pain', 'Age: 32, Gender: Female', 'Moderate', NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens spine and posture\",\"steps\":[\"Lie flat on your stomach with legs together and tops of feet on the floor.\",\"Place hands under shoulders, elbows close to the body.\",\"Inhale and slowly lift your chest off the floor while keeping the navel down.\",\"Keep shoulders relaxed and gaze slightly upward.\",\"Hold for 15-30 seconds, then exhale and lower slowly.\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"reps_sets\":\"3-5 rounds\",\"contraindications\":\"severe_back_injury\"},{\"name\":\"Balasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"balasana.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/2MJGg-dUKh0\",\"benefits\":\"Relieves back tension and stress\",\"steps\":[\"Kneel on the floor with big toes touching and sit on your heels.\",\"Separate your knees about hip-width apart.\",\"Exhale and lay your torso down between your thighs.\",\"Rest your forehead on the mat and stretch your arms forward or alongside the body.\",\"Breathe deeply and hold for 1-3 minutes.\"],\"duration\":\"3 mins\",\"reps_sets\":\"3-5 rounds\",\"contraindications\":\"none\"},{\"name\":\"Marjariasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"marjariasana.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Ov65nNSWrfw\",\"benefits\":\"Improves spinal flexibility\",\"steps\":[\"Start on your hands and knees in a tabletop position.\",\"Inhale, drop your belly, and look up toward the ceiling (Cow Pose).\",\"Exhale, round your spine, and tuck your chin toward your chest (Cat Pose).\",\"Flow between these two movements with your breath.\",\"Repeat for 10-15 rounds to improve spinal flexibility.\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"reps_sets\":\"3-5 rounds\",\"contraindications\":\"pregnancy\"}]', '{\"yoga\":[{\"name\":\"Bhujangasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"bhujangasana.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/luTSRGXPEMs\",\"benefits\":\"Strengthens spine and posture\",\"steps\":[\"Lie flat on your stomach with legs together and tops of feet on the floor.\",\"Place hands under shoulders, elbows close to the body.\",\"Inhale and slowly lift your chest off the floor while keeping the navel down.\",\"Keep shoulders relaxed and gaze slightly upward.\",\"Hold for 15-30 seconds, then exhale and lower slowly.\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"reps_sets\":\"3-5 rounds\",\"contraindications\":\"severe_back_injury\"},{\"name\":\"Balasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"balasana.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/2MJGg-dUKh0\",\"benefits\":\"Relieves back tension and stress\",\"steps\":[\"Kneel on the floor with big toes touching and sit on your heels.\",\"Separate your knees about hip-width apart.\",\"Exhale and lay your torso down between your thighs.\",\"Rest your forehead on the mat and stretch your arms forward or alongside the body.\",\"Breathe deeply and hold for 1-3 minutes.\"],\"duration\":\"3 mins\",\"reps_sets\":\"3-5 rounds\",\"contraindications\":\"none\"},{\"name\":\"Marjariasana\",\"image_keyword\":\"marjariasana.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Ov65nNSWrfw\",\"benefits\":\"Improves spinal flexibility\",\"steps\":[\"Start on your hands and knees in a tabletop position.\",\"Inhale, drop your belly, and look up toward the ceiling (Cow Pose).\",\"Exhale, round your spine, and tuck your chin toward your chest (Cat Pose).\",\"Flow between these two movements with your breath.\",\"Repeat for 10-15 rounds to improve spinal flexibility.\"],\"duration\":\"5 mins\",\"reps_sets\":\"3-5 rounds\",\"contraindications\":\"pregnancy\"}],\"ayurveda\":[{\"name\":\"Ginger-Lemon\",\"image_keyword\":\"ginger_lemon.jpg\",\"video\":\"https://youtube.com/shorts/UJzkdo4spd0?si=ViOME2xJ9aI_I7UC\",\"usage\":\"ginger;lemon;honey;water\",\"dosage_timing\":\"Avoid empty stomach\",\"benefits\":\"Supports holistic health.\",\"type\":\"Herbal\",\"ingredients\":\"ginger;lemon;honey;water\",\"preparation_time\":\"10 mins\"},{\"name\":\"Ashwagandha Milk\",\"image_keyword\":\"ashwagandha.jpg\",\"video\":\"h